# Execution Plane Boundary

- Read `docs-governance/EXECUTION_PLANE_BOUNDARY_SPEC.md` before editing voice runtime or session machinery.
- Do not place heavy DB queries, prompt compilation, direct domain workflow logic, or UI rendering inside execution-plane files.
- Execution-plane code may dispatch typed actions, but it must remain blind to business semantics beyond that boundary.
- Treat the voice runtime as a latency-sensitive hot path.
